; Models: two bars of a plucked melody in D minor | Neglects: a reverb | IO: (t) -> amplitude | Tags: loop
0.9*(@voice-pluck(t, f0=A4, len=0.1875b) + @voice-pluck(t - 0.1875b, f0=D5, len=0.1875b) + @voice-pluck(t - 0.375b, f0=F5, len=0.125b) + @voice-pluck(t - 0.5b, f0=E5, len=0.125b) + @voice-pluck(t - 0.625b, f0=D5, len=0.125b) + @voice-pluck(t - 0.75b, f0=C5, len=0.25b) + @voice-pluck(t - 1.0b, f0=D5, len=0.1875b) + @voice-pluck(t - 1.1875b, f0=A4, len=0.1875b) + @voice-pluck(t - 1.375b, f0=C5, len=0.125b) + @voice-pluck(t - 1.5b, f0=Bb4, len=0.125b) + @voice-pluck(t - 1.625b, f0=A4, len=0.125b) + @voice-pluck(t - 1.75b, f0=G4, len=0.125b) + @voice-pluck(t - 1.875b, f0=A4, len=0.125b))
